title: Tech-support scam browser locker
severity: high
score: 60
tags: tech-support-scam, scam
attack: T1656, T1204.001
description: The page used lock-in APIs (fullscreen re-entry, pointer/keyboard lock, forced
  audio) and shows a support phone number with scare wording.
---
// A tech-support scare with a phone number ...
tech_support_frames
// ... on a page that takes over the screen, the pointer or the keyboard.
| where exists(fullscreen_requests) or exists(pointer_lock_requests) or exists(keyboard_lock_requests)
| project url, phone = extract(list("lures.tech_support_phone"), 0, content)
